# Credential stores - see src/auth.py and src/authdb.py. The glob covers
# device_tokens.json.migrated, which still holds plaintext cookies until
# it is deleted by hand.
data/device_tokens.json*

# Runtime database. The app writes to this at draft time, and it accumulates
# real league history - team and manager names - as it goes. Committing it
# guarantees dirty trees and merge conflicts, and publishes third parties'
# names. Rebuild it from the notebooks, or ship a reference copy instead.
data/fantasy_data.db
data/runtime/
